        <Param val="Thank you for your responses!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We now have a number of questions to ask you about how you perceive the world around you.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;These questions will ask you to rate how much you agree or disagree with a given statement. Please read each statement carefully and respond as truthfully as possible. For each item, press the corresponding numeric value on the NUMERIC KEYPAD to enter your response. Once you press an answer key, your response will be immediately recorded so please be thoughtful about your answers.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;There are no right or wrong answers. Press the SPACE BAR to begin." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
